# jetmora.org — © 2026 sun-dive
# ⚠ Directory listing is ON by default on this host: an empty docroot served "Index of /".
# index.html covers the root, but spec/ and vectors/ would otherwise be browsable listings.
Options -Indexes

# Serve the spec and the vectors as readable text rather than prompting a download.
AddType text/plain .md
AddCharset UTF-8 .md .json .html
